d configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","type":"reference"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","type":"reference"},{"text":" documentation for more information about tile","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/i